ne & path tools | world-editor-viewport\n1050\t   modes | Environment tool-mode hosting | world-editor-viewport\n1051\t   preview-scenes | Isolated preview scenes & asset inspection viewports | world-editor-viewport\n1052\t   blockout | Blockout & in-editor modeling (primitives, booleans, UVs) | world-editor-viewport\n1053\t   ld-utilities | Level-design utilities: measure, filters, bulk replace, layer visibility | world-editor-viewport\n1054\t   2d-mode | 2D/orthographic editing, pixel snapping, sorting-layer tools | world-editor-viewport\n1055\t # ED.GRAPH Graph editors\n1056\t   framework | Node-graph editor framework | graph-editor-framework\n1057\t   compile | Graph compile & validation contract | graph-editor-framework\n1058\t   debug | Graph debugging | graph-editor-framework\n1059\t   diff | Graph diff & merge | graph-editor-framework\n1060\t # ED.COLLAB Collaboration & version control\n1061\t   vcs | Source control integration (Perforce, Git class) | collaboration-version-control\n1062\t   locking | Locking & checkout workflows | collaboration-version-control\n1063\t   multiuser | Multi-user concurrent editing | collaboration-version-control\n1064\t   merge | Merge tooling for scene & asset data | collaboration-version-control\n1065\t   review | Content review workflows | collaboration-version-control\n1066\t   binaries | Large binary storage strategy | collaboration-version-control\n1067\t   partial-sync | Sparse/virtualized workspaces & on-demand payloads | collaboration-version-control\n1068\t # ED.DEBUG Visual debugging\n1069\t   draw | Debug draw API | visual-debugging-tools\n1070\t   console | In-game console & cheat commands | visual-debugging-tools\n1071\t   inspector | Runtime entity inspector & gameplay debugger | visual-debugging-tools\n1072\t   visual-log | Visual logger & rewind | visual-debugging-tools\n1073\t   menus | Debug menus & overlays | visual-debugging-tools\n1074\t   imgui | Immediate-mode developer UI (in-game, with remote front end