{"parentUuid":"67b86800-b75a-4dcf-964e-ffc17f9ffe70","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a24ca00379f5322b6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MUaHz9RCtxEmr5VDqveqzV","type":"tool_result","content":"== face track|body track|avatar\n== trial|demo build|timed\n== offline\ndata/capabilities.json:TP/CDN IO backend with persistent content cache, prefetch & offline policy\ndata/capabilities.json:RND.PT.offline\ndata/capabilities.json:Offline / cinematic render mode\ndata/capabilities.json:Audio oracle suite: bit-exact offline render, loudness, glitch & latency\ndata/capabilities.json:AUD.ARCH.offline-render\n== cloth (author|paint|edit)|cloth tool|groom\ndata/radar.json:UE Groom; Frostbite strands\n== vcam|take record|recorder|gameplay recording\ndata/capabilities.json:Physics visual debugger & recorder\ndata/skills.json:ragdoll and constraint editors, the physics visual debugger/recorder, simulate-in-editor, vehicle and controller tuning, 2D coll\n== musical|quantiz|sample-accurate\ndata/capabilities.json:Half, packed & quantized numeric formats\ndata/capabilities.json:Mesh optimization (vertex cache/fetch, quantization, tangents)\ndata/capabilities.json:Model packaging, quantization & versioning\ndata/capabilities.json:Delta compression, quantization & bit packing\ndata/skills.json:tive-vector / tensor) and CPU backends, model packaging and quantization, scheduling within frame budgets, determinism characte\n== production track|shotgrid|ftrack|outsourc|vendor\ndata/capabilities.json:Vendor & driver workaround management\ndata/capabilities.json:D3D12 backend: vendor/driver quirk handling\ndata/capabilities.json:Vulkan backend: vendor/driver quirk handling\ndata/capabilities.json:Metal backend: vendor/driver quirk handling\ndata/capabilities.json:WebGPU backend: vendor/driver quirk handling\n== minimap|world map\n== visibility|occlusion cull\ndata/capabilities.json:Shading path choice (forward+, deferred, visibility buffer)\ndata/capabilities.json:GPU frustum & two-phase HZB occlusion culling\ndata/capabilities.json:Visibility-buffer rasterization (TBDR suitability ADR required)\ndata/capabilities.json:vel-design utilities: measure, filters, bulk replace, layer visibility\ndata/skills.json:line organization, shading-path choice (forward+, deferred, visibility buffer), render-feature contract, render scene and world→\n== editor locali|localized editor\n== big|large number\ndata/capabilities.json:Debug declared-vs-actual access checking & system-order ambiguity detection\n== stadium|commentary\n== benchmark mode\n== brush|CSG\ndata/skills.json:tire models (Pacejka, brush)\n== pre-?load|unlock\ndata/capabilities.json:ANM.CINE.preload\ndata/capabilities.json:Cutscene streaming & preloading\ndata/capabilities.json:Transition peak analysis (travel, cutscene preload, cell churn)\ndata/skills.json:meras, high-quality movie rendering, cutscene streaming and preloading.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5ebb46d6-2a40-43b9-87f7-c90f95205f5c","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:01.300Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"67b86800-b75a-4dcf-964e-ffc17f9ffe70","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
